{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses one-shot conservative recovery after obstacle events, keeps action states robust to open-loop pulse semantics by self-looping on non-critical path_clear, and returns quickly to forward exploration once path_clear is observed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two plant automata",
    "Use a main policy specification with perception states and one-shot action/recovery states",
    "Bias clear conditions to move_forward for coverage, with random_walk available only through the plant but disabled by the policy",
    "Handle obstacle_left with rotate_clockwise and obstacle_right with rotate_counterclockwise consistently",
    "Handle obstacle_front with a brief move_backward escape, then a short directed turn, then return to exploration as soon as path_clear occurs",
    "Reserve full_rotate in the plant only; do not enable it in ordinary policy states"
  ],
